Subject: [PATCH] Tracking v2: location, returning visitors, sports viewed,
 device

---
 index.html                          | 14 +++--
 netlify/functions/stats.js          | 82 ++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 netlify/functions/track.js          | 59 ++++++++++++++++-----
